<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1329734055"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1444573285"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="melty world"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Kizuna AI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Melty World"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:15.983"><div begin="00:01.357" end="04:15.983"><p begin="00:01.357" end="00:03.786" itunes:key="L395">Dance stepで染めて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用舞步感染四周</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Dance step de so me te</span></p><p begin="00:03.816" end="00:08.367" itunes:key="L458">このFloorのBeatに身をゆだね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把身体交给舞池的节奏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no floor no beat ni mi wo yu da ne</span></p><p begin="00:08.797" end="00:12.219" itunes:key="L396">Nonstopで越えて 描け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要停下 超越吧 描绘吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Nonstop de ko e te e ga ke</span></p><p begin="00:12.249" end="00:15.743" itunes:key="L459">Gateway to the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">通向世界的入口</span></p><p begin="00:15.243" end="00:16.927" itunes:key="L424">To the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">通向世界</span></p><p begin="00:16.937" end="00:18.962" itunes:key="L425">To the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">通向世界</span></p><p begin="00:18.972" end="00:20.679" itunes:key="L426">To the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">通向世界</span></p><p begin="00:20.689" end="00:22.565" itunes:key="L430">To the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">通向世界</span></p><p begin="00:22.575" end="00:29.158" itunes:key="L431">To the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">通向世界</span></p><p begin="00:31.236" end="00:33.901" itunes:key="L397">Dance stepで染めて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用舞步感染四周</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Dance step de so me te</span></p><p begin="00:33.931" end="00:38.183" itunes:key="L457">この手 その手 音に飲まれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这双手 那双手 都沉浸在音乐中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no te so no te o to ni no ma re</span></p><p begin="00:38.755" end="00:41.365" itunes:key="L398">Don't stop 焦がれて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要停下 急不可耐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Don't stop ko ga re te</span></p><p begin="00:41.395" end="00:45.573" itunes:key="L456">ここで叫べ "hello, world"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就在此呐喊吧“hello world”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko de sa ke be “hello world”</span></p><p begin="00:46.290" end="00:52.180" itunes:key="L399">I keep moving towards the world 届けたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不断向着世界前进</span></p><p begin="00:52.210" end="00:53.719" itunes:key="L427">届けたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要传达</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to do ke ta i</span></p><p begin="00:53.749" end="00:59.145" itunes:key="L400">I never look back anymore それだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不再沉湎过去 仅此而已</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I never look back anymore so re da ke</span></p><p begin="01:01.297" end="01:04.279" itunes:key="L401">Dance &amp; Dance そろそろね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跳舞吧 跳舞吧 差不多要开始</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Dance &amp; dance so ro so ro ne</span></p><p begin="01:05.070" end="01:08.797" itunes:key="L402">Done Done Done 次の世界へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去往下一个世界了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Done done done tsu gi no se ka i he</span></p><p begin="01:08.827" end="01:11.876" itunes:key="L403">ドアの向こうから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从门的另一边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do a no mu ko u ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:11.906" end="01:15.860" itunes:key="L404">僕らを待っている音<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">传来等待着我们的音乐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra wo ma 't te i ru o to</span></p><p begin="01:17.068" end="01:17.920" itunes:key="L428">Everything<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切的一切</span></p><p begin="01:17.930" end="01:19.513" itunes:key="L429">Everything</p><p begin="01:20.705" end="01:23.281" itunes:key="L405">Everything's gonna be alright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切都会好起来的</span></p><p begin="01:23.692" end="01:28.763" itunes:key="L406">始めようよ Beatに揺られて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开始吧 随着节奏摇摆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ji me yo u yo beat ni yu ra re te</span></p><p begin="01:28.793" end="01:30.763" itunes:key="L407">So melty heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心脏也融化进节奏中</span></p><p begin="01:30.153" end="01:31.911" itunes:key="L432">To the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着世界</span></p><p begin="01:31.921" end="01:33.876" itunes:key="L433">To the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着世界</span></p><p begin="01:33.886" end="01:35.723" itunes:key="L434">To the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着世界</span></p><p begin="01:35.733" end="01:37.610" itunes:key="L435">To the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着世界</span></p><p begin="01:37.620" end="01:44.168" itunes:key="L436">To the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着世界</span></p><p begin="01:46.300" end="01:48.769" itunes:key="L408">Dance stepで染めて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用舞步感染四周</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Dance step de so me te</span></p><p begin="01:48.799" end="01:53.192" itunes:key="L454">このFloorのBeatに身をゆだね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把身体交给舞池的节奏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no floor no beat ni mi wo yu da ne</span></p><p begin="01:53.740" end="01:57.314" itunes:key="L409">Nonstopで越えて 描け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要停下 超越吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Nonstop de ko e te</span></p><p begin="01:57.324" end="02:00.107" itunes:key="L455">Gateway to the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">描绘吧 通向世界的入口</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e ga ke gateway to the world</span></p><p begin="02:01.286" end="02:07.155" itunes:key="L410">I keep moving towards the world 届けたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不断向着世界前进</span></p><p begin="02:07.185" end="02:08.739" itunes:key="L437">届けたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要传达</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to do ke ta i</span></p><p begin="02:08.779" end="02:14.021" itunes:key="L411">I never look back anymore それだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不再沉湎过去 仅此而已</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I never look back anymore so re da ke</span></p><p begin="02:16.233" end="02:18.151" itunes:key="L412">Put your hands up now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把你的手高举起来</span></p><p begin="02:18.161" end="02:20.045" itunes:key="L438">Put your hands up now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把你的手高举起来</span></p><p begin="02:20.055" end="02:21.397" itunes:key="L439">Put your hands up now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把你的手高举起来</span></p><p begin="02:21.407" end="02:23.759" itunes:key="L440">Put your put your hands up now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把你的手高举起来</span></p><p begin="02:23.769" end="02:25.654" itunes:key="L441">Put your hands up now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把你的手高举起来</span></p><p begin="02:25.664" end="02:27.495" itunes:key="L443">Put your hands up now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把你的手高举起来</span></p><p begin="02:27.505" end="02:28.886" itunes:key="L442">Put your hands up now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把你的手高举起来</span></p><p begin="02:28.896" end="02:30.871" itunes:key="L14633">Put your put your hands up now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把你的</span></p><p begin="03:03.040" end="03:06.026" itunes:key="L413">Dance &amp; Dance そろそろね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跳舞吧 跳舞吧 已经差不多了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Dance &amp; dance so ro so ro ne</span></p><p begin="03:06.906" end="03:10.649" itunes:key="L414">Done Done Done 次の世界で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在下一个世界中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Done done done tsu gi no se ka i de</span></p><p begin="03:10.679" end="03:13.575" itunes:key="L415">ドアの向こうには<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在门的另一边 有我们崭新的音乐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do a no mu ko u ni wa bo ku ra no a ta ra shi i o to</span></p><p begin="03:13.605" end="03:17.716" itunes:key="L416">僕らの新しい音</p><p begin="03:18.901" end="03:19.774" itunes:key="L444">Everything<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切的一切</span></p><p begin="03:19.784" end="03:21.104" itunes:key="L445">Everything</p><p begin="03:22.646" end="03:25.708" itunes:key="L417">Everything's gonna be alright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切都会好起来的</span></p><p begin="03:25.738" end="03:30.609" itunes:key="L418">始めようよ Beatに揺られて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开始吧 随着节奏摇摆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ji me yo u yo beat ni yu ra re te</span></p><p begin="03:30.639" end="03:32.464" itunes:key="L419">So melty world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世界也融化进节奏中</span></p><p begin="03:32.115" end="03:33.844" itunes:key="L447">To the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着世界</span></p><p begin="03:33.854" end="03:35.691" itunes:key="L448">To the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着世界</span></p><p begin="03:35.701" end="03:37.585" itunes:key="L449">To the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着世界</span></p><p begin="03:37.595" end="03:39.456" itunes:key="L450">To the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着世界</span></p><p begin="03:39.466" end="03:45.906" itunes:key="L451">To the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着世界</span></p><p begin="03:48.127" end="03:50.718" itunes:key="L420">Dance stepで染めて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用舞步感染四周</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Dance step de so me te</span></p><p begin="03:50.748" end="03:55.162" itunes:key="L452">この手 その手 音に飲まれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这双手 那双手 都沉浸在音乐中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no te so no te o to ni no ma re</span></p><p begin="03:55.634" end="03:58.277" itunes:key="L421">Don't stop 焦がれて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要停下 急不可耐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Don't stop ko ga re te</span></p><p begin="03:58.307" end="04:02.336" itunes:key="L453">ここで叫べ "hello, world"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就在此呐喊吧“hello world”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko de sa ke be “hello world”</span></p><p begin="04:03.164" end="04:09.054" itunes:key="L422">I keep moving towards the world 届けたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不断向着世界前进</span></p><p begin="04:09.084" end="04:10.625" itunes:key="L446">届けたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要传达</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to do ke ta i</span></p><p begin="04:10.655" end="04:15.983" itunes:key="L423">I never look back anymore つなげたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不再沉湎过去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to do ke ta i</span></p></div></body></tt>